#################################################################

errc:EliminateHandMaintainedCapabilityCopy a errc:Finding ;
    rdfs:label "Eliminate: autofde-lab's hand-typed capability allowlist as a manual transcription with no generated link back to gymact" ;
    errc:category "Eliminate" ;
    errc:statement "src/autofde_lab/fabric/gymact_capabilities.toml is a hand-typed subset of gymact/gyms/sregym.py::SREGYM_CAPABILITIES with no generated/checked link -- confirmed this session: the TOML's own comment claims the real source has only 5 capabilities; the real source now has 14. The allowlist is not wrong (its 5 admitted entries are all real), but its own justifying comment is already false, undetected until read by hand." ;
    errc:evidence "Direct read, 2026-08-11: ~/gymact/src/gymact/gyms/sregym.py SREGYM_CAPABILITIES tuple has 14 entries; ~/autofde-lab/src/autofde_lab/fabric/gymact_capabilities.toml's header comment states 5." ;
    errc:impact "Eliminable once gymact_capabilities.toml is generated from this pack's admitted facts instead of hand-copied -- named follow-up, not done in this pack version." .

errc:EliminateThirdErrcVocabulary a errc:Finding ;
    rdfs:label "Eliminate: inventing a third ERRC RDF shape when two already exist and one is reusable" ;
    errc:category "Eliminate" ;
    errc:statement "packs/gh-actions-errc-pack and packs/pack-authoring-pack independently invented two incompatible ERRC representations (per-cell RDF individuals vs. one markdown-blob-per-doc). This pack reuses gh-actions-errc-pack's errc:Finding verbatim." ;
    errc:evidence "packs/gh-actions-errc-pack/ontology.ttl errc:Finding class; packs/pack-authoring-pack/ontology.ttl pat:ErrcDoc markdown-blob shape." ;
    errc:impact "One queryable ERRC vocabulary across packs instead of three." .

errc:ReduceScopeToLoadBearingThree a errc:Finding ;
    rdfs:label "Reduce: build the 3 load-bearing folders of the proposed 13-folder domain-pack architecture, not all 13" ;
    errc:category "Reduce" ;
    errc:statement "Of ontology/source-provenance/taxonomy/state-model/desired-state-rules/violation-modes/observation-contracts/authority-contracts/planner-compatibility/remediation-patterns/verification-rules/world-projection/lab-projection/production-projection, only authority-contracts, observation-contracts, and the world/lab projection split have a real, grounded instance today (SREGym's capability surface). The other 10 have no current instance to ground them." ;
    errc:evidence "This session's own automatic-autonomic-operations-pack precedent: closed-by-construction, but only because its scope (15 capabilities, one repo) stayed small." ;
    errc:impact "Avoids building 10 empty/aspirational folders whose shape can't yet be validated against real data." .

errc:ReduceProductionProjectionToNonGoal a errc:Finding ;
    rdfs:label "Reduce: production-projection to a documented non-goal for this pack version" ;
    errc:category "Reduce" ;
    errc:statement "autofde (governed production execution) is not a reachable repo this session; a prod: projection slot is named but not built." ;
    errc:evidence "No autofde checkout present in this session's reachable repos." ;
    errc:impact "Keeps this version's scope to what could actually be verified against real files." .

errc:RaiseDriftGuardedProjection a errc:Finding ;
    rdfs:label "Raise: capability-list fidelity from hand-copied subset to generated, drift-guarded projection" ;
    errc:category "Raise" ;
    errc:statement "gates/020_exact_count_per_source.rq and gates/030_allowlist_subset.rq make it structurally impossible for an admitted LabAllowlist to reference a Capability that isn't real, and impossible for a source's capability count to silently drift undetected within THIS graph." ;
    errc:evidence "gates/020_exact_count_per_source.rq, gates/030_allowlist_subset.rq (this pack)." ;
    errc:impact "The concrete mechanism a generated gymact_capabilities.toml (follow-up) would rely on to stay honest." .

errc:RaiseProofSurfaceToDomainGeneral a errc:Finding ;
    rdfs:label "Raise: automatic-autonomic-operations-pack's proof-surface discipline from ggen-kernel-local to domain-general" ;
    errc:category "Raise" ;
    errc:statement "aa:ProofSurface (positive execution / negative refusal / receipt-replay) is a real, reusable idea currently trapped in one pack's ggen-kernel scope. This pack's count/uniqueness gates are that same discipline, generalized to an arbitrary external domain's capability list." ;
    errc:evidence "packs/automatic-autonomic-operations-pack/ontology.ttl aa:ProofSurface." ;
    errc:impact "Same discipline now applies to any future domain instance admitted into this pack, not only ggen's own kernel." .

errc:CreateDomainCapabilityPack a errc:Finding ;
    rdfs:label "Create: packs/domain-capability-pack itself, with one real worked instance, not an empty template" ;
    errc:category "Create" ;
    errc:statement "dcp:Capability / dcp:LabAllowlist / dcp:CapabilitySourceManifest, admitting SREGym's real 14 capabilities and autofde-lab's real 5-entry allowlist, with 2 gates that would catch the exact drift already found while authoring this pack." ;
    errc:evidence "This pack's own ontology.ttl (14 dcp:Capability + 1 dcp:LabAllowlist individuals) and gates/." ;
    errc:impact "The 80/20 answer to the autonomic/automation gap: proves the vocabulary against real, already-existing data instead of shipping a schema no one has tried yet." .

errc:ExtendDomainCapabilityPackContractLayer a errc:Finding ;
    rdfs:label "Create (v0.2.0): the DOMAIN-family contract layer with realizations grounded in the real Ash surface, consumable by a capability-resolution engine" ;
    errc:category "Create" ;
    errc:statement "v0.1.0 transcribed one world's capability list but expressed no capability CONTRACT: no realization bindings, no authority requirements, no outcome sets, no qualification conditions -- nothing a resolver could select against. v0.2.0 adds dcp:DomainCapability / dcp:Realization composed with qce:'s lifecycle (realizations ARE qce:QualifiedCapability individuals), the 3 pinned IDs (Domain.Action.Invoke / Domain.Query.Read / Domain.Change.Apply) plus 5 grounded siblings, and 6 new refusal gates. Every realization names a module actually read this session (Ash.Reactor.*Step, AshPPlan.Providers.Steps.DomainAction, Ash.CodeInterface, Ash.bulk_*/4) with real sha256 artifact digests." ;
    errc:evidence "Read-only inspection 2026-09-30 of ~/ash_pplan @de92fceb (lib/ash_pplan/providers/*, lib/ash_pplan/provider.ex, deps/ash 3.33.11 reactor steps, code_interface, bulk actions); docs/jira/v26.9.30/RESOLUTIONS.md pinned IDs and namespaces." ;
    errc:impact "The DOMAIN family joins the qualified capability ecology as admitted source-of-record: plans target dcp:DomainCapability identities; resolvers select dcp:Realization bindings; neither grants authority (gates 070/080/090)." .

errc:AlignLegacyNamespace a errc:Finding ;
    rdfs:label "Eliminate (v0.2.0): a second, ad-hoc namespace spelling for a family the wave has pinned" ;
    errc:category "Eliminate" ;
    errc:statement "v0.1.0 published dcp: at http://seanchatmangpt.github.io/packs/domain-capability# before the capability-ecology wave pinned family namespaces at https://ggen.dev/ontology/<family>-capability#. The vocabulary moved verbatim to the pinned IRI with per-term dcterms:isReplacedBy records (dcp:NamespaceAlignment2026-09-30); nothing was deleted or renamed silently, and both known consumers of the legacy IRIs carry self-contained copies in their own qualification fixtures." ;
    errc:evidence "docs/jira/v26.9.30/RESOLUTIONS.md namespace table (dcp: -> https://ggen.dev/ontology/domain-capability#); gym-upper-ontology-pack and standing-ladder-pack qualification fixtures embed their own legacy-IRI copies (read 2026-09-30)." ;
    errc:impact "One namespace per family across the capability ecology; consumers resolve pinned dotted IDs through one stable IRI." .
